  "title": "HEARTH Study",
  "summary": "A cohort study of how the home environment affects breathing in young children.",
  "description": {
    "html": "<p>HEARTH follows 800 families from the child's first year to age five. We measure indoor air, housing conditions, and respiratory symptoms.</p><h2>Aims</h2><ol><li><p>Estimate the effect of gas stoves on wheeze.</p></li><li><p>Identify housing repairs that reduce symptoms.</p></li></ol>",
